**Tourism Experience Analytics**

This project focuses on Tourism Experience Analytics using the real-world data.A stored procedure was created to combine all relevant tables into a single dataset,
followed by data cleaning and exploratory data analysis (EDA) to handle missing values and uncover insights through visualizations.

The final output is an interactive Streamlit dashboard that includes three core features: a regression model to predict visitor ratings, 
a classification model to identify visit modes (eg., solo, family, friends), and a recommendation system that suggests tourist attractions based on user preferences.
